Package: felege-metsahft
Version: @VERSION@
Section: education
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Felege Metsahft <support@felegemetsahft.com>
Homepage: https://felegemetsahft.com
Depends: libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libsecret-1-0, libepoxy0, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libstdc++6, libc6
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: Ethiopian religious books reader
 Felege Metsahft is a reader for Ethiopian religious books, with offline
 access to a personal encrypted library, bookmarks, highlights, notes and
 reading plans. Supports Amharic and English interfaces.
